  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion of Press freedom, access to information and the Safety of journalists in AU Member states within the Framework of the Africa Media Convention Recommendations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addis LO will provide support in taking forward the recommendations from the 2nd Africa Media Convention in Lusaka Zambia which took place in May 2023 and the African Union STC-C-ICT in October 2023. Among the actions to be supported include
(i)	 Hosting the annual Africa Media Convention within the framework of the World PressFreedom Day, 
(ii)	Africa Media Review Journal to be produced annually and provide in-depth documentation of media development ideas as an anchor for the content and institutional memory of the Africa Media Convention 
(iii)	Packaging of the AU Media fellowship training content &#x2013; into a curriculum to be delivered to the annual cohorts in English and French</narrative>
  </description>
